part tsb_5
  tally 2
  law
  note "TSB-5 · Tax on the interest: on each redemption (of a series, TSB-4.1) 19 % of the amount paid per bond less 100.00 DUK, times the bonds redeemed, rounded (GEN-5.1) (.1)."

